# Recorded digest of the known-good deterministic plugin package.
#
# tools/decky-oxp3-status/build.sh writes build/oxp3-status-<version>.zip with
# fixed timestamps and sorted entries, so rebuilding the same sources reproduces
# this hash.  tools/oxp3-hw-install.sh --decky verifies a reused zip against this
# value before installing it; a freshly built zip is installed as-is (a changed
# source legitimately changes the digest) and only reports a mismatch.
#
# Regenerate after an intentional source change:
#   cd tools/decky-oxp3-status && ./build.sh --offline
#   sha256sum build/oxp3-status-*.zip   # then update the line below
9a2979f7f4b03b113480c7a90f4225e902e607f9dc944a41e3d39430a7314c74  oxp3-status-1.0.0.zip
